  "note": "VALID CONTRACT-QUALITY RUN. F-002 maps to adjudicated D-001 through behavior B-002 and the same observable partial-match leak. The fresh sealed arm issued a composed-filter request, isolated each filter with single-filter controls, emitted FAIL, and therefore satisfies amendment 02's preregistered causal-support rule for this case. The prior valid sealed run with contract v1 emitted PASS and never supplied two filters together. The evaluator-visible intervention was B-002's oracle; the mutation, ground truth, task, prompt template, model, budgets, credentials, and API remained unchanged. This supports the narrow case-level claim that oracle authoring controlled recall here. It cannot count as an original frozen-condition unique catch, satisfy the three-real-defect H0 gate, or move H0 from INCOMPLETE. Finding types keep three confirmations and one low observation out of the defect precision denominator, yielding 1 correct defect finding from 1 alleged defect. Cleanup was attempted through the permitted API and failed because no DELETE route was exposed; two clearly named evaluation capsules remain and are documented in the exact trace. Every assistant message used claude-sonnet-5. Claude Code reported a small auxiliary Haiku internal overhead with no assistant message or evaluator action, disclosed in the isolation manifest."
